    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "WorkArena consists of a set of tasks that are designed to test the ability of web agents to perform common work-related tasks. Each task is coupled with a natural language goal that provides instructions to the agent. <strong>BrowserGym</strong> is an environment that facilitates the design of new benchmarks and provides a solid platform for evaluating multi-modal web agents. It offers a rich set of actions and multimodal observations, and supports chat-based interactions between the user and the web agent.",
