    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The experiments show that while current web agents are capable of solving some tasks, there is still a significant gap towards achieving full task automation. The results highlight the importance of <strong>large language models</strong> in improving the performance of web agents. The study also finds that the use of <strong>BrowserGym features</strong> such as chat-based interactions and multimodal observations can significantly improve the performance of web agents.",
